+
+- loop invariant;
+- loop invariant plus unrestricted entry;
+- loop invariant plus the `n=0` entry; and
+- loop invariant plus the `n=5` entry.
+
+Build evidence is in `evidence/stage3-build.log`; concrete comparisons are in
